exit: 0
--- stdout
Redis clusters

Usage:
  cloudru-dbaas redis clusters [command]

Aliases:
  clusters, cluster

Available Commands:
  create      Create a cluster
  delete      Delete a cluster (irreversible, requires --yes)
  get         Cluster: status, host addresses, configuration
  list        List project clusters
  resize      Update a cluster: specification, disk, parameters

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for clusters

Global Flags:
      --api-url string     Redis Public API URL (default "https://redis.api.cloud.ru")
      --json               output JSON (for scripts and agents)
      --project string     cloud.ru project id (default "proj-1")
      --timeout duration   time limit for --wait (default 30m0s)

Use "cloudru-dbaas redis clusters [command] --help" for more information about a command.
